  "name": "Armor Training (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, a dragoon learns to be more maneuverable, even while encumbered by armor.</p><p>Whenever he is wearing armor, he reduces the armor check penalty by 1 (to a minimum of 0) and increases the maximum Dexterity bonus allowed by his armor by 1. Every four levels thereafter (7th, 11th, 15th, and 19th), these bonuses increase by +1 each time, to a maximum –5 reduction of the armor check penalty and a +5 increase of the maximum Dexterity bonus allowed.</p><p>In addition, a dragoon can also move at his normal speed while wearing medium armor.</p><p>At 7th level, a dragoon can move at his normal speed while wearing heavy armor.</p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
